$MDESC::Type = "ISN Maps";
$MDESC::Text = "<s3><f1>Mission Type: <f0> Capture the Flag" @
         "\n<f1>Planet: <f0> Occam Prime" @
         "\n<f1>Weather: <f0> Clear" @
         "\n<f1>Time of Day: <f0> Midday" @ 
         "\n<f1># of Teams: <f0> 2" @
         "\n\n<f1>Briefing:<f0> The <vServer::teamName0> and <vServer::teamName1> face off in a dance of war.  Grabbing the other tribe's flag and successfully bringing it back to your base and touching it to your own flag to capture it, earns your tribe a point.  The first tribe to ten points shall be the victor!\n\n<f1>HARD CORPS map by:<f0> [SHIT]Warpath";